# CodSoft Internship - Task 2: Landing Page

This project is developed as **Task 2** of my **Web Development Internship at CodSoft**.

The goal of this project is to design a **responsive and visually appealing landing page** using HTML and CSS while applying basic web development concepts such as layout design, sections, alignment, and styling.

## 🚀 Features

- Responsive landing page design
- Clean and modern user interface
- Navigation bar
- Hero section
- Features section
- About section
- Pricing section
- Contact form
- Footer section

## 🛠 Technologies Used

- HTML5
- CSS3

## 📂 Project Structure

landing-page  
│  
├── index.html  
├── style.css  

## 🎯 Learning Outcomes

Through this project I learned:

- Structuring webpages using HTML
- Styling layouts using CSS
- Creating responsive designs
- Using colors, spacing, and alignment effectively

